ealousy can point the way to a better life&quot;,&quot;trailText&quot;:&quot;It’s tempting to ignore uncomfortable feelings – but maybe they’re the key to a happier, more successful future. Time to increase your psychological flexibility …&quot;,&quot;webPublicationDate&quot;:&quot;2026-11-08T10:00:37.000Z&quot;,&quot;kickerText&quot;:&quot;Health&quot;,&quot;supportingContent&quot;:[],&quot;discussionApiUrl&quot;:&quot;https://discussion.theguardian.com/discussion-api&quot;,&quot;byline&quot;:&quot;Anita Chaudhuri&quot;,&quot;showByline&quot;:false,&quot;snapData&quot;:{},&quot;boostLevel&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;showMiniNav&quot;:false,&quot;isImmersive&quot;:false,&quot;isCrossword&quot;:false,&quot;isNewsletter&quot;:false,&quot;isNewsletterSignup&quot;:false,&quot;showQuotedHeadline&quot;:false,&quot;showLivePlayable&quot;:false,&quot;isExternalLink&quot;:false,&quot;showVideo&quot;:false,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://media.guim.co.uk/4bc3317eee37ffeab6cf85046c6c38af9d4dbe36/0_0_5000_4000/master/5000.jpg&quot;,&quot;altText&quot;:&quot;An illustration showing a woman from behind with long dark hair looking at the sky which has an orange sun and black clouds. &quot;}},{&quot;format&quot;:{&quot;design&quot;:10,&quot;display&quot;:0,&quot;theme&quot;:4},&quot;dataLinkName&quot;:&quot;feature | group-0 | card-@4&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;/lifeandstyle/2026/nov/07/yes-saunas-are-great-but-have-you-heard-of-this-amazing-thing-called-a-bath&quot;,&quot;headline&quot;:&quot;Yes, saunas are great – but have you heard of this amazing thing called a bath?&quot;,&quot;trailText&quot;:&quot;Ever since the ancient Greeks, we’ve suspected that soaking in hot water is good for your health. Now science has proved it&quot;,&quot;webPublicationDate&quot;:&quot;2026-11-07T05:00:02.000Z&quot;,&quot;kickerText&quot;:&quot;Baths&quot;,&quot;supportingContent&quot;:[],&quot;discussionApiUrl&quot;:&quot;https://discussion.theguardian.com/discussion-api&quot